<% content_for :title, "新建审批任务｜江苏东华 AI 工作平台" %><% content_for :page_title, "审批任务" %><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl"><%= link_to "← 返回项目", @project, class: "text-sm font-semibold text-cyan-700" %><h1 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold">新建审批任务</h1><p class="mt-2 rounded-md bg-cyan-50 p-3 text-sm text-cyan-900">选择债权时，本任务自动绑定当前审核层级及材料版本；未通过时不能通过该层。会签全部通过后仍需本层人员确认，不自动作出债权结论。</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500"><%= @project.name %></p><div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><%= form_with model: [@project, @task], class: "space-y-6" do |form| %><%= render "shared/errors", record: @task %><%= render "signers" %><div><%= form.label :record_ref, "审批对象", class: "mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold" %><%= form.select :record_ref, @record_options, {}, class: "w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 px-3.5 py-2.5" %></div><div><%= form.label :stage, "流程阶段", class: "mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold" %><%= form.text_field :stage, required: true, placeholder: "初审、复核、合伙人审批等", class: "w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 px-3.5 py-2.5" %></div><div><%= form.label :assignee_id, "处理人", class: "mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold" %><%= form.collection_select :assignee_id, @assignees, :id, :name, { prompt: "请选择处理人" }, class: "w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 px-3.5 py-2.5" %></div><div><%= form.label :due_at, "截止时间", class: "mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold" %><%= form.datetime_local_field :due_at, class: "w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 px-3.5 py-2.5" %></div><div class="flex justify-end gap-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-5"><%= link_to "取消", @project, class: "rounded-xl px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600" %><%= form.submit "创建任务", class: "cursor-pointer rounded-xl bg-slate-950 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white" %></div><% end %></div></div>
